{"c_reyes|Commander, welcome to the Frontier. Twelve years of Legion occupation, and Starfall did not end it. We end it now — the hard way.":["1cuuqhs.mp3",7.89],"c_reyes|That changes today. Deploy your Mobile HQ in the north-west, get ore flowing and build a strike force.":["mic0vd.mp3",5.76],"c_hale|Hale here, ma'am. Scouts put a Legion outpost in the south-east corner. Conscripts and light armour. Nothing we can't handle.":["1c43ik0.mp3",7.66],"c_hale|Mobile HQ is on the ground. Find open ground and deploy when ready.":["1853nnk.mp3",4.5],"gb2_m|Ey up. Where d'you want us?":["3x6tct.mp3",2.19],"gb2_m|Right then, where are we settin' up?":["bkrxw6.mp3",1.5],"gb2_m|Big lass is ready, boss.":["ymiklt.mp3",1.45],"c_reyes|Ore is flowing. Now a War Factory — I want Grizzlies on that road.":["mbs3xk.mp3",3.93],"c_hale|Gem deposit dead centre, ma'am. That's a fortune in the ground.":["mtegoe.mp3",3.54],"c_hale|Contact! Legion infantry probing our perimeter!":["16gg610.mp3",3.31],"c_draganov|Vanguard? This valley belongs to the Legion. Go home while you still have legs.":["kgd4r9.mp3",4.84],"c_reyes|Clean work, Commander. The Legion will remember this — and so will I.":["oi513f.mp3",4.09],"c_reyes|We lost the beachhead. Regroup — we go again.":["77cfat.mp3",2.88],"c_reyes|Landfall. Primary objectives.":["yzob73.mp3",2.36],"c_reyes|First: Deploy your base and build a Refinery.":["9njv0u.mp3",2.57],"c_reyes|Then: Destroy the Legion outpost.":["8966zp.mp3",2.26],"c_reyes|The Legion fell back across the Kessel River and dug in on the east bank.":["1yu356u.mp3",3.92],"c_reyes|There is a high bridge between the central bluffs. Whoever holds the east bluff controls the crossing.":["1mqom3b.mp3",5.15],"c_hale|Their War Factory in the north-east is feeding tanks straight onto that bridge. Take the bluff, then take the factory.":["1n4mbid.mp3",6.8],"c_hale|The bridge deck is the fast way across. The road bridges north and south are slower, but they'll be watching the deck.":["zgxc1n.mp3",6.62],"c_hale|Rhinos rolling across the north bridge!":["1j6mfzc.mp3",2.5],"c_reyes|The bluff is ours. Artillery on that deck and push for the factory.":["1mm8ram.mp3",3.95],"c_draganov|You cross my river, Colonel? Then you will swim back.":["1ro83aq.mp3",3.14]}